Dictionary.com
has recently added

00:10:02.868 --> 00:10:06.471
"finna" and "supposably"
to its online database,

00:10:06.471 --> 00:10:08.307
as in, "Supposably,

00:10:08.307 --> 00:10:11.143
I'm finna stop using
dictionary.com."

00:10:11.143 --> 00:10:12.377
[ Laughter ]

00:10:12.377 --> 00:10:13.379
According to a new report,

00:10:13.379 --> 00:10:14.713
legalizing marijuana created

00:10:14.713 --> 00:10:16.715
77,000 new jobs last year.

00:10:16.715 --> 00:10:19.919
Or, put another way,
77,000 people forgot

00:10:19.919 --> 00:10:22.821
to show up at their old jobs.
[ Laughter ]

00:10:22.821 --> 00:10:24.222
And, finally,
it was announced yesterday

00:10:24.222 --> 00:10:25.791
that Tiger Woods
will be featured

00:10:25.791 --> 00:10:29.394
on the PGA 2K video game,
though, for obvious reasons,

00:10:29.394 --> 00:10:31.764
he's being removed
from "Mario Kart."
[ Laughter ]

00:10:31.764 --> 00:10:33.432
♪♪

00:10:33.432 --> 00:10:35.101
Ahead of yesterday's
virtual summit

00:10:35.101 --> 00:10:37.469
between the prime minister
of Ireland and President Biden,

00:10:37.469 --> 00:10:39.237
the Irish government
sent the White House

00:10:39.237 --> 00:10:41.339
a traditional bowl of shamrocks

00:10:41.339 --> 00:10:43.508
and we sent them the traditional
American gift --

00:10:43.508 --> 00:10:46.344
a bouquet of Tomahawk
cruise missiles.

00:10:46.344 --> 00:10:48.547
Former President Trump
is reportedly planning to sit

00:10:48.547 --> 00:10:51.417
for 12 interviews
over the next few weeks

00:10:51.417 --> 00:10:52.885
with authors writing books
about him.

00:10:52.885 --> 00:10:54.419
Twelve books!

00:10:54.419 --> 00:10:56.121
Harry Potter
didn't even get 12 books.

00:10:56.121 --> 00:10:57.556
What's left to know?

00:10:57.556 --> 00:10:59.324
"Oh, wow.
It says here that,

00:10:59.324 --> 00:11:00.626
as a husband,

00:11:00.626 --> 00:11:02.728
he was sub par."

00:11:02.728 --> 00:11:04.930
Twelve Republican congressmen,
yesterday, voted

00:11:04.930 --> 00:11:07.099
against honoring
law enforcement officers

00:11:07.099 --> 00:11:09.101
who responded
to the Capitol siege

00:11:09.101 --> 00:11:11.536
because they disagreed
with the bill's characterization

00:11:11.536 --> 00:11:13.672
of the attack
as an insurrection.

00:11:13.672 --> 00:11:15.573
Apparently,
they'd rather think of it

00:11:15.573 --> 00:11:18.177
as an overbooked tour.

00:11:18.177 --> 00:11:20.146
The NCAA March Madness
basketball tournament

00:11:20.146 --> 00:11:21.713
began today,
and it's extra exciting

00:11:21.713 --> 00:11:23.782
because there was
no tournament last year,

00:11:23.782 --> 00:11:27.385
so this is my first chance
in two years to get furious

00:11:27.385 --> 00:11:30.423
at 19-year-olds I hadn't
heard of five minutes ago.

00:11:30.423 --> 00:11:33.092
Pass it, Johnson!
You're not a shooter!

00:11:33.092 --> 00:11:35.794
Damn you,
Northeast Tennessee A&amp;M!

00:11:35.794 --> 00:11:38.864
The mayor of Lyon, France,
recently caused an outrage

00:11:38.864 --> 00:11:40.799
after he announced
that school menus

00:11:40.799 --> 00:11:42.768
would no longer include meat,

00:11:42.768 --> 00:11:45.003
which means those poor kids
will have to switch

00:11:45.003 --> 00:11:46.705
to white wine.

00:11:46.705 --> 00:11:48.407
[ Laughter ]

00:11:48.407 --> 00:11:50.509
Today was Awkward Moments Day,

00:11:50.509 --> 00:11:52.945
this news first reported
by the guy who's actually

00:11:52.945 --> 00:11:54.747
waving to the person behind you.

00:11:54.747 --> 00:11:56.114
[ Laughter ]

00:11:56.114 --> 00:11:57.917
And, finally,
the goat population

00:11:57.917 --> 00:12:00.619
of a town in North Wales
has experienced a sharp rise

00:12:00.619 --> 00:12:03.789
after officials were unable
to provide contraceptives

00:12:03.789 --> 00:12:05.724
to the goats,
due to the pandemic,

00:12:05.724 --> 00:12:08.694
and it's been really hard
on the kids.

00:12:08.694 --> 00:12:11.997 line:0%
♪♪

00:12:11.997 --> 00:12:13.933 line:0%
[ Whistling and applause ]

